WEBVTT

01:31.590 --> 01:32.430
Nanny Zhou!

01:33.840 --> 01:35.950
Why were you being unwilling?

01:36.310 --> 01:37.430
Didn't you hear that?

01:37.640 --> 01:38.229
Mr. Liu is being

01:38.229 --> 01:39.789
promoted to Junior Vice Minister of Revenue.

01:40.070 --> 01:41.560
It's a third-rank official!

01:41.920 --> 01:43.120
Such a good match

01:43.200 --> 01:44.759
should be for my daughter Lan.

01:44.920 --> 01:46.350
Why should Jinzhao take him!

01:46.870 --> 01:48.680
This match only appears good,

01:48.789 --> 01:49.950
nothing more.

01:50.200 --> 01:50.870
How?

01:51.680 --> 01:52.680
That Young Master Liu

01:52.680 --> 01:53.870
is no good.

01:54.310 --> 01:55.150
Only eighteen,

01:55.400 --> 01:56.310
he's already bedded

01:56.310 --> 01:57.789
several maids in his house.

01:58.950 --> 02:00.230
Any girl who marries him will

02:00.280 --> 02:01.430
have nothing but hardship ahead.

02:04.120 --> 02:05.430
I may not have that much

02:05.560 --> 02:06.950
bad blood with Jinzhao.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.240
My dear Mistress!

02:09.430 --> 02:10.710
You're too kind!

02:11.430 --> 02:12.630
Jinzhao didn't go easy on you

02:12.710 --> 02:13.800
when she bullied you.

02:14.560 --> 02:15.280
Besides, Master

02:15.590 --> 02:17.240
only asked you to make the arrangements.

02:17.560 --> 02:18.240
Whether she

02:18.240 --> 02:19.030
actually marries into

02:19.150 --> 02:20.360
that family isn't your call.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.360
It's up to Master and Madame.

02:22.710 --> 02:24.520
Why bother going against Master's wishes?

02:25.150 --> 02:26.280
Haven't you always wanted to

02:26.280 --> 02:27.310
have leverage over Jinzhao?

02:28.150 --> 02:29.079
This marriage

02:29.280 --> 02:30.590
is the best leverage.

02:31.960 --> 02:32.870
Indeed.

02:36.240 --> 02:36.750
Alright,

02:37.310 --> 02:38.360
I'll take this task.

02:44.680 --> 02:45.120
Miss,

02:45.560 --> 02:46.800
as you instructed,

02:46.840 --> 02:47.840
I've secretly checked

02:47.910 --> 02:49.190
everyone in our courtyard.

02:49.680 --> 02:50.630
No holes

02:50.800 --> 02:52.630
found yet.

02:53.710 --> 02:54.280
I'll check again

02:54.630 --> 02:55.470
the carriage house

02:55.470 --> 02:56.960
and the errand office.

02:57.430 --> 02:58.590
Everyone and everything

02:58.590 --> 03:00.030
that's had contact with us,

03:00.190 --> 03:00.910
I'll go it through.

03:01.750 --> 03:02.870
I know,

03:03.400 --> 03:04.590
even if I

03:04.750 --> 03:06.080
find out that lurker,

03:06.560 --> 03:07.800
I can't do much with them.

03:09.150 --> 03:10.080
But at least I'll know

03:10.310 --> 03:11.310
where we stand.

03:13.150 --> 03:14.400
Here comes Lan!

03:20.800 --> 03:21.520
Jinzhao!

03:23.800 --> 03:24.360
Please have a seat.

03:27.470 --> 03:29.310
Someone just came to propose marriage for you!

03:29.910 --> 03:30.960
I was behind the screen

03:31.079 --> 03:32.430
when the matchmaker arrived,

03:32.710 --> 03:33.630
and when I heard

03:33.750 --> 03:35.360
it was for you,

03:35.430 --> 03:36.470
I rushed right over.

03:36.710 --> 03:38.520
They asked the matchmaker to send word

03:38.520 --> 03:39.560
to the Liu family today.

03:39.910 --> 03:40.960
If the Liu find it suitable,

03:40.960 --> 03:42.470
they'll deliver the birth-date betrothal slip!

03:46.190 --> 03:47.310
The Liu family

03:47.310 --> 03:48.560
is an old noble house,

03:48.800 --> 03:50.630
having produced several Jinshi scholars.

03:51.079 --> 03:52.079
If Mr. Liu is promoted

03:52.079 --> 03:53.710
to Junior Vice Minister of Revenue,

03:53.840 --> 03:55.360
that would be another step up.

03:55.710 --> 03:57.560
And Mrs. Liu

03:57.840 --> 04:00.310
is the sister of the Changxing Marchioness.

04:01.080 --> 04:02.590
What kind of person is the boy?

04:03.120 --> 04:04.470
Since Master has chosen him,

04:04.680 --> 04:06.030
he must be a good man.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.280
Am I right, Master?

04:08.430 --> 04:09.000
His father

04:09.000 --> 04:11.000
and I have served together in the Revenue Ministry for years,

04:11.120 --> 04:13.430
so we know each other well.

04:14.190 --> 04:16.000
I've never heard anything wrong

04:16.000 --> 04:17.070
with that boy.

04:17.720 --> 04:19.630
Besides, he's also passed the preliminary exams.

04:19.829 --> 04:20.510
I hear he's even

04:20.870 --> 04:22.560
taken the autumn provincial exam this session.

04:23.430 --> 04:25.920
Busy studying for the exams,

04:26.240 --> 04:27.240
his character

04:27.630 --> 04:28.920
can't be too bad.

04:30.830 --> 04:32.270
Sounds good enough.

04:34.070 --> 04:36.000
Jinzhao has already turned fifteen,

04:36.870 --> 04:38.750
so we should start looking into marriage prospects.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.360
Jinzhao,

04:40.720 --> 04:41.720
what do you think?

04:42.600 --> 04:43.510
So,

04:44.159 --> 04:44.830
the matchmaker

04:45.159 --> 04:46.600
has already sent word to the Liu family?

04:47.360 --> 04:48.040
Yes.

04:49.830 --> 04:50.430
Two families

04:50.430 --> 04:51.600
haven't met for the viewing.

04:52.159 --> 04:53.560
I don't even know what the young Liu

04:53.950 --> 04:55.000
looks like.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.430
Why the rush?

04:57.000 --> 04:57.870
As if I'm the one

04:57.870 --> 04:59.480
rushing to marry him.

05:01.120 --> 05:02.310
That's right.

05:02.720 --> 05:04.040
After all, we're the bride's family.

05:04.510 --> 05:05.870
What's noble being the bride's family?

05:06.950 --> 05:08.510
Jinzhao has just arrived in the capital

05:08.510 --> 05:09.480
and hadn't started socializing yet.

05:10.040 --> 05:12.000
They don't know her at all.

05:12.270 --> 05:13.630
How could they come to propose first?

05:14.160 --> 05:15.000
Besides,

05:15.630 --> 05:17.270
given the Liu family's status,

05:18.040 --> 05:20.000
what's wrong with lowering ourselves a bit?

05:20.360 --> 05:21.480
The real benefit is what counts,

05:21.720 --> 05:22.830
isn't it?

05:23.870 --> 05:24.800
Does my grandmother

05:25.160 --> 05:26.270
know about this?

05:27.830 --> 05:29.070
I just found out myself

05:29.360 --> 05:31.270
and haven't written to her.

05:32.040 --> 05:34.159
She raised me up.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.750
If marriage is being arranged for me,

05:35.920 --> 05:37.070
she should have been told first.

05:38.430 --> 05:38.950
Right.

05:39.430 --> 05:41.680
She is far away in Tongzhou.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.870
Once this matter takes shape,

05:44.159 --> 05:45.270
it's still soon enough

05:45.270 --> 05:46.430
to tell her.

05:54.390 --> 05:55.390
Are you

05:55.800 --> 05:56.510
deliberately

05:56.510 --> 05:57.600
keeping this from her?

05:58.830 --> 05:59.870
What are you talking about?

06:01.240 --> 06:02.600
Since ancient times,

06:03.430 --> 06:04.680
marriage is decided

06:05.160 --> 06:06.950
by parents

06:06.950 --> 06:08.560
and matchmakers.

06:09.750 --> 06:10.720
Your grandmother

06:10.720 --> 06:12.240
just needs to be informed.

06:12.750 --> 06:13.950
Whether she agrees

06:14.240 --> 06:15.310
or not,

06:15.510 --> 06:17.750
she doesn't get the final say.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.070
Oh really?

06:21.310 --> 06:22.560
But I heard that

06:22.750 --> 06:24.560
Grandmother strongly opposed it

06:24.920 --> 06:26.480
when my mother married you.

06:27.070 --> 06:29.120
Your own parents also disagreed.

06:29.800 --> 06:30.920
Yet you insisted

06:31.070 --> 06:32.510
on marrying anyway.

06:33.270 --> 06:34.159
Why didn't you

06:34.159 --> 06:35.680
obey your parents

06:35.680 --> 06:36.800
back then?

06:37.480 --> 06:38.680
You unfilial daughter!

06:38.830 --> 06:40.630
How dare you say such a thing?

06:40.800 --> 06:41.830
Fine.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.190
In any case, this matter

06:43.390 --> 06:44.720
must have Grandmother's consent,

06:44.920 --> 06:46.070
otherwise, I won't agree.

06:46.430 --> 06:46.950
You!

06:47.800 --> 06:48.630
I'll take my leave now.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.070
Ma'am!

07:01.630 --> 07:02.750
I'll go check on

07:02.920 --> 07:04.480
the lunch preparations.

07:13.270 --> 07:13.720
See?

07:14.480 --> 07:16.240
This is your pampered daughter!

07:16.830 --> 07:17.680
I don't think

07:17.680 --> 07:19.120
she's completely wrong.

07:20.310 --> 07:21.560
I should inform my mother first.

07:21.720 --> 07:23.120
There's no rush.

07:23.630 --> 07:24.510
Besides,

07:24.950 --> 07:26.120
arranging a marriage for Jinzhao

07:26.430 --> 07:27.950
right after she came back

07:28.070 --> 07:29.310
is indeed too early.

07:29.680 --> 07:31.160
Too early?

07:31.480 --> 07:32.600
You've seen

07:33.159 --> 07:35.560
how she defies her elders.

07:38.159 --> 07:39.830
Making a scene at her coming-of-age ceremony

07:40.270 --> 07:41.600
was bad enough, but that's

07:41.600 --> 07:42.800
on your Ji family's turf.

07:43.390 --> 07:45.750
The Lin's birthday banquet was such a formal occasion,

07:46.190 --> 07:48.510
and she dared to openly talk back to me in front of everyone!

07:50.270 --> 07:52.270
Which family with a son

07:52.270 --> 07:53.390
would want to

07:53.480 --> 07:54.800
marry her after that?

07:56.430 --> 07:57.190
I tell you,

07:57.190 --> 07:58.360
we must quickly arrange

07:58.920 --> 07:59.630
a match for her before

07:59.800 --> 08:01.040
she causes even bigger trouble,

08:01.160 --> 08:02.870
then she really won't marry off at all!

08:07.950 --> 08:08.800
Talk some sense into her!

08:16.240 --> 08:17.800
Why didn't you try to stop Master?

08:18.800 --> 08:19.720
Enough about him.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.160
This Young Master Liu.

08:23.160 --> 08:24.870
Master thinks highly of him,

08:25.040 --> 08:26.870
but I still don't feel sure.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.360
Have Luo Yongping

08:29.560 --> 08:30.630
go make some inquiries.

08:32.080 --> 08:32.549
Yes, ma'am.

08:36.909 --> 08:39.080
You've never even met Liu Xiancheng.

08:39.360 --> 08:41.270
Why this refusal?

08:44.480 --> 08:46.320
Is it because of

08:48.440 --> 08:49.840
Mr. Ye Xian?

08:52.150 --> 08:53.550
What does that have to do with him?

08:55.630 --> 08:57.120
I'm just saying.

08:58.510 --> 08:59.390
Why does Father

08:59.390 --> 09:01.030
suddenly care about my marriage?

09:01.790 --> 09:02.720
This can't be

09:02.910 --> 09:04.120
that simple.

09:05.840 --> 09:07.030
We need more information

09:07.030 --> 09:07.960
from outside.

09:09.750 --> 09:10.670
What are you doing?

09:11.270 --> 09:12.320
How dare you trespass

09:12.320 --> 09:13.270
on my Miss's grounds?

09:17.600 --> 09:18.960
What are you doing?

09:19.550 --> 09:20.510
Master has ordered

09:21.150 --> 09:22.720
that from today, Jinzhao should

09:23.030 --> 09:24.270
remain in the residence and

09:24.670 --> 09:25.720
may not leave

09:25.870 --> 09:26.870
without his consent.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.240
He's going to ground me?

09:28.480 --> 09:29.440
Miss,

09:30.240 --> 09:31.270
he ordered us to

09:31.630 --> 09:32.910
keep you here no matter what.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.150
Anyone who

09:34.150 --> 09:35.510
let you out without permission

09:35.600 --> 09:36.720
will be beaten and then

09:36.840 --> 09:38.120
taken away by slave brokers.

09:38.870 --> 09:40.440
We're just following orders.

09:41.200 --> 09:43.030
We hope you won't take offense.

09:44.000 --> 09:45.550
You old hag! I...

09:49.960 --> 09:51.630
Miss, why are you stopping me?

09:52.480 --> 09:54.000
Is there any way you can help me get out of here?

10:04.910 --> 10:06.440
Thanks for your help.

10:07.600 --> 10:08.630
But if Father

10:08.630 --> 10:09.960
finds out,

10:10.150 --> 10:11.270
will he punish you?

10:12.200 --> 10:13.150
It's okay.

10:13.360 --> 10:14.200
He's never once

10:14.270 --> 10:14.790
blamed me

10:14.790 --> 10:16.120
since I was little.

10:17.150 --> 10:17.720
You can

10:17.720 --> 10:18.510
take off

10:18.510 --> 10:19.550
Ziling's clothes later.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.030
Take this.

10:29.390 --> 10:31.080
If this match goes through,

10:31.120 --> 10:32.000
there'll be a great reward.

10:33.870 --> 10:34.360
By the way,

10:35.240 --> 10:36.150
when you

10:36.150 --> 10:37.320
see Mrs. Ji,

10:37.960 --> 10:39.030
remember to tell her...

10:43.670 --> 10:44.480
Jinzhao,

10:44.670 --> 10:45.870
your new outfit

10:45.870 --> 10:46.870
is really beautiful.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.360
What fabric is this?

10:49.000 --> 10:49.870
If you like it,

10:50.030 --> 10:50.630
I'll buy you

10:50.630 --> 10:52.000
another bolt.

10:52.630 --> 10:54.240
Thank you, Jinzhao.

10:55.550 --> 10:56.080
Miss Jinzhao.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.270
Miss Lan.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.120
When I heard Mr. Liu took

10:59.120 --> 11:00.080
this session's exam,

11:00.240 --> 11:01.000
I sent someone

11:01.000 --> 11:02.200
to watch near the exam hall.

11:02.270 --> 11:03.870
How one acts when the results are posted

11:04.120 --> 11:05.720
shows a person's true color most clearly.

11:06.240 --> 11:08.360
He's at the Fuchun Teahouse.

11:08.960 --> 11:09.870
What a coincidence.

11:10.440 --> 11:12.000
As you want to inquire about him,

11:12.480 --> 11:13.270
Madame also ordered

11:13.360 --> 11:14.790
me to look into the Liu family,

11:15.120 --> 11:17.030
saying his character comes first.

11:17.630 --> 11:18.360
My mother

11:18.790 --> 11:19.720
also asked you?

11:20.080 --> 11:21.720
Yes. It's only proper

11:21.790 --> 11:22.840
for her to care about

11:22.960 --> 11:23.960
your marriage.

11:25.080 --> 11:25.870
I was

11:25.870 --> 11:26.840
wondering

11:27.000 --> 11:28.720
whether to report to Mrs. Ji,

11:29.150 --> 11:29.790
but the servant

11:29.790 --> 11:31.320
back from Tongzhou said

11:31.550 --> 11:33.480
she had been ill,

11:34.000 --> 11:35.910
so I hesitated.

11:36.840 --> 11:37.870
Grandmother had been ill?

11:42.000 --> 11:43.720
[The head of the family, Mrs. Ji,]

11:43.910 --> 11:45.630
[has had several fires set on her property.]

11:46.120 --> 11:46.840
[Now,]

11:47.030 --> 11:48.150
[before every meal,]

11:48.360 --> 11:50.080
[she must use a silver needle to test for poison.]

11:51.870 --> 11:53.200
Don't tell her just yet.

11:53.870 --> 11:54.390
Yes, Miss.

11:55.870 --> 11:56.670
Let's go inside.

11:57.960 --> 11:58.440
Okay.

12:02.030 --> 12:02.600
Miss,

12:03.240 --> 12:04.870
that's Liu Xiancheng.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.910
Isn't that Chen Xuanqing?

12:25.320 --> 12:27.000
I was wondering why there are so many girls.

12:27.910 --> 12:29.360
Turns out they are here to see him.

12:29.480 --> 12:30.000
Look,

12:30.270 --> 12:31.200
that one looks good

12:31.870 --> 12:33.200
with a pair of dimples.

12:34.360 --> 12:35.510
The one next to her? No.

12:36.670 --> 12:37.840
Doesn't deserve to sit here.

12:39.030 --> 12:39.960
Please be cautious, Mr. Liu.

12:43.600 --> 12:44.870
What's there to be cautious about?

12:45.630 --> 12:46.840
These girls chase you

12:47.000 --> 12:48.000
all the way to the exam hall.

12:48.870 --> 12:49.840
They aren't cautious,

12:50.080 --> 12:50.960
so why should I be?

12:51.150 --> 12:51.720
Mr. Liu,

12:52.120 --> 12:52.960
you've got it wrong.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.080
First, these girls may not

12:55.270 --> 12:56.240
even be here for me.

12:56.630 --> 12:57.320
Even if they are,

12:57.630 --> 12:58.720
they're courteous

12:58.960 --> 12:59.840
and haven't bothered us.

13:01.030 --> 13:02.440
For us to scrutinize them

13:02.790 --> 13:04.000
would violate a gentleman's way.

13:04.960 --> 13:05.480
Moreover,

13:06.000 --> 13:06.960
women already have

13:07.120 --> 13:08.240
a harder time in this world.

13:08.630 --> 13:09.960
Men shoot their mouths off

13:10.240 --> 13:11.150
and move on, but if

13:12.240 --> 13:13.790
those words get out, it could

13:14.270 --> 13:15.030
become a stain

13:15.240 --> 13:16.600
on a woman's name

13:18.440 --> 13:20.200
and no chance for her to defend herself.

13:20.720 --> 13:22.150
We all have sisters.

13:22.840 --> 13:24.120
Put yourself in their place.

13:24.510 --> 13:25.720
Be more cautious.

13:25.790 --> 13:26.440
Fine, fine.

13:26.630 --> 13:27.510
I won't talk.

13:27.910 --> 13:29.200
Mr. Liu, I envy your carefree attitude.

13:29.600 --> 13:31.080
The rest of us are on edge,

13:31.360 --> 13:32.200
yet you still have

13:32.480 --> 13:33.840
romance on your mind.

13:34.870 --> 13:36.600
I wasn't going to pass anyway.

13:37.360 --> 13:38.670
If my mother hadn't forced me,

13:39.360 --> 13:40.200
I wouldn't have come.

13:41.550 --> 13:42.600
No wonder Xuanqing

13:42.600 --> 13:43.630
is so well-liked.

13:43.750 --> 13:45.200
He speaks so convincingly.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.270
Liu Xiancheng,

13:46.270 --> 13:47.870
on the other hand, is just too crude.

13:48.120 --> 13:49.390
Crude? That's putting it mildly.

13:50.030 --> 13:50.960
On results day,

13:51.270 --> 13:52.390
a candidate dares to

13:52.870 --> 13:53.750
act so recklessly

13:53.840 --> 13:55.000
right in front of the exam hall.

13:55.750 --> 13:57.120
Either he's got some backing,

13:57.750 --> 13:59.320
or he's a complete fool.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.240
The results are out!

14:15.240 --> 14:15.870
The results are out!

14:16.000 --> 14:16.790
Let's go!

14:18.030 --> 14:18.510
Xuruo,

14:18.510 --> 14:19.550
let's go down and take a look.

14:19.790 --> 14:20.390
Let's go.

14:20.480 --> 14:21.120
Go, go.

14:21.510 --> 14:22.030
Look!

14:22.150 --> 14:22.840
The results are out!

14:35.390 --> 14:36.000
The results are out!

14:36.440 --> 14:37.630
Look!

14:39.000 --> 14:39.630
The results are out!

14:39.670 --> 14:40.360
Take a good look!

14:40.670 --> 14:41.320
That's fast!

14:41.320 --> 14:41.910
Am I included?

14:43.550 --> 14:44.030
Look!

14:47.510 --> 14:48.030
Look!

14:48.750 --> 14:49.320
Am I included?

14:49.630 --> 14:50.240
Yes!

14:53.670 --> 14:54.390
Jinzhao, look!

14:54.600 --> 14:55.240
The results are out!

14:58.910 --> 14:59.390
Yes!

14:59.390 --> 14:59.870
Sir,

15:00.150 --> 15:01.120
why are you still here?

15:01.270 --> 15:02.390
Let's go down and take a look!

15:02.670 --> 15:04.790
When the Bingzi provincial exam results

15:05.270 --> 15:06.080
were announced,

15:06.630 --> 15:07.840
Uncle Yanyun was waiting right here.

15:08.240 --> 15:08.750
Today,

15:09.750 --> 15:10.630
I'll wait here too.

15:11.030 --> 15:12.150
Then I'll stay with you.

15:22.720 --> 15:25.910
The 49th place of Yiyou

15:26.200 --> 15:28.390
is Chen Yanwen from Xiheyan Street.

15:28.390 --> 15:30.030
Wanping County,

15:30.510 --> 15:31.720
Shuntian Prefecture.

15:32.270 --> 15:32.840
Elective: The Book of Songs.

15:32.840 --> 15:33.270
Sir!

15:33.270 --> 15:33.790
I passed!

15:34.120 --> 15:34.790
I passed!

15:35.390 --> 15:36.510
I passed!

15:36.910 --> 15:38.030
Congratulations!

15:38.630 --> 15:39.360
It's Mr. Chen Yanwen!

15:39.480 --> 15:40.790
Sir, your uncle Yanwen passed!

15:41.150 --> 15:42.510
Shouldn't we congratulate him?

15:43.870 --> 15:44.360
Xuruo,

15:44.960 --> 15:45.550
why did your uncle

15:45.550 --> 15:46.670
also take this exam?

15:47.480 --> 15:48.030
Congratulations!

15:52.000 --> 15:52.550
Mr. Liu,

15:53.120 --> 15:54.720
I'll go congratulate my uncle.

16:08.510 --> 16:09.080
Miss Gu.

16:27.870 --> 16:28.670
Congratulations!

16:28.670 --> 16:29.870
Congratulations on passing it!

16:31.440 --> 16:32.320
Thank you! Thank you!

16:32.480 --> 16:33.440
Congratulations!

16:33.600 --> 16:34.320
Thank you!

16:34.630 --> 16:35.960
Thank you, everyone!

16:37.030 --> 16:37.960
Mr. Jiang found out

16:37.960 --> 16:39.510
the truth about my father's death,

16:40.750 --> 16:42.200
so I brought it to you.

16:44.790 --> 16:45.480
It was

16:47.240 --> 16:48.480
Uncle Yanwen.

16:53.150 --> 16:53.790
That day,

16:54.720 --> 16:55.750
he and my father

16:55.750 --> 16:56.750
met on a bridge.

16:57.030 --> 16:57.910
They argued.

16:58.670 --> 16:59.750
Uncle Yanwen pushed

16:59.750 --> 17:00.870
my father into a pond.

17:01.720 --> 17:03.270
He struggled to the bank

17:03.790 --> 17:05.069
and nearly got out of the water,

17:06.829 --> 17:08.030
but Uncle Yanwen

17:08.550 --> 17:10.000
pried his fingers open

17:11.200 --> 17:12.550
and pushed him off again.

17:14.550 --> 17:15.480
Congratulations!

17:15.720 --> 17:16.640
Congrats!

17:18.790 --> 17:19.750
Congratulations!

17:20.400 --> 17:20.880
Sir,

17:21.270 --> 17:22.640
shouldn't we go congratulate?

17:23.200 --> 17:23.750
Never mind,

17:24.790 --> 17:25.510
let's just stay here.

17:26.000 --> 17:26.960
Thank you!

17:28.790 --> 17:30.200
I'll treat you later!

17:30.310 --> 17:31.160
Congrats!

17:31.160 --> 17:32.030
Congratulations!

17:32.070 --> 17:32.920
Congrats!

17:32.920 --> 17:33.790
Congratulations!

17:33.920 --> 17:35.310
Congratulations!

17:35.440 --> 17:36.240
Congratulations!

17:39.070 --> 17:40.160
The 3rd place of Yiyou

17:40.550 --> 17:41.790
is Zhuang Zhengyu

17:42.310 --> 17:44.510
from Xisipailou,

17:44.920 --> 17:46.270
Wanping County,

17:46.720 --> 17:48.160
Shuntian Prefecture.

17:48.720 --> 17:49.880
- Elective: The Book of Documents.
- It's me!

17:49.960 --> 17:50.480
It's me!

17:50.550 --> 17:52.240
I passed!

17:52.270 --> 17:53.350
Congratulations!

17:54.550 --> 17:55.880
Thank you! Thank you!

17:56.000 --> 17:57.350
Only the top two are left.

17:58.000 --> 17:59.830
Liu Xiancheng definitely won't make it.

18:00.240 --> 18:00.680
But there's

18:00.880 --> 18:02.550
still no Chen Xuanqing.

18:02.720 --> 18:04.720
He couldn't have failed, could he?

18:05.790 --> 18:06.830
The 2nd place of Yiyou

18:06.960 --> 18:08.160
is Liu Kezuan

18:08.590 --> 18:12.240
from Xiaowang Town, Gaoyang County,

18:12.440 --> 18:13.550
Baoping Prefecture.

18:14.110 --> 18:15.000
Elective: The Book of Rites.

18:15.750 --> 18:16.960
It's me!

18:17.000 --> 18:18.000
Congratulations!

18:18.110 --> 18:19.200
Thank you!

18:19.510 --> 18:20.030
Thank you!

18:20.880 --> 18:21.720
Congratulations!

18:21.720 --> 18:22.310
Congrats!

18:22.310 --> 18:23.400
The 1st place of Yiyou,

18:23.590 --> 18:24.590
with elective:

18:24.920 --> 18:26.030
The Spring and Autumn Annals,

18:30.830 --> 18:33.240
is the one from Xiheyan Street,

18:33.550 --> 18:35.110
Wanping County,

18:38.480 --> 18:40.030
Shuntian Prefecture—

18:41.200 --> 18:42.270
Chen Xuanqing.

18:43.880 --> 18:44.750
Sir! Sir!

18:44.750 --> 18:45.480
It's you!

18:45.680 --> 18:47.830
You're in the first place!

18:50.830 --> 18:51.960
Here's the winner!

18:52.110 --> 18:53.240
Here's the winner!

18:53.480 --> 18:54.350
Here he is!

18:57.000 --> 18:57.830
Congratulations!

18:58.590 --> 19:00.160
Congratulations to the winner!

19:00.510 --> 19:01.270
Congratulations!

19:01.270 --> 19:02.350
Congratulations!

19:02.480 --> 19:03.750
Congratulations!

19:03.830 --> 19:05.070
Congratulations!

19:05.070 --> 19:05.720
Congratulats!

19:05.720 --> 19:06.720
Congratulations!

19:32.480 --> 19:32.880
Sir,

19:33.270 --> 19:33.960
here's

19:33.960 --> 19:34.960
the autumn exam pass list.

19:35.070 --> 19:35.590
Please take a look.

19:44.200 --> 19:46.440
He's being too conspicuous.

19:47.960 --> 19:49.000
Passing is enough.

19:49.310 --> 19:51.030
Why did he aim for the first place?

19:52.400 --> 19:53.200
As for Yanwen,

19:54.240 --> 19:55.440
he doesn't live up to this.

19:59.480 --> 20:00.680
There's nothing we can do about it.

20:01.030 --> 20:02.160
The Shuntian chief examiner

20:02.350 --> 20:03.830
has long wanted your favor.

20:04.200 --> 20:04.830
This time, it just

20:04.960 --> 20:05.640
happens to coincide

20:05.640 --> 20:07.270
that Xuanqing and Yanwen are taking the exam.

20:07.750 --> 20:09.400
Of course he's eager to curry favor.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.790
I've read Yanwen's essay.

20:12.270 --> 20:13.200
Passing or not,

20:13.350 --> 20:14.830
it could go either way.

20:15.480 --> 20:16.550
Thanks to you,

20:16.720 --> 20:17.830
of course he passed.

20:17.960 --> 20:19.000
That's what I'm worried about.

20:19.270 --> 20:20.000
Next spring

20:20.070 --> 20:21.240
he'll surely take the exams.

20:21.590 --> 20:22.510
What if he meets

20:22.510 --> 20:23.790
an ambitious

20:24.070 --> 20:25.160
chief examiner?

20:26.000 --> 20:27.510
Are you worried about him

20:27.790 --> 20:28.750
because of the Fifth Master?

20:29.200 --> 20:30.720
You know Yanwen.

20:31.240 --> 20:32.510
He'll get himself trouble

20:33.310 --> 20:34.240
once he enters officialdom.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.200
What happened?

20:44.920 --> 20:46.400
Sir, the axle is broken.

20:47.000 --> 20:47.830
Can it be repaired?

20:48.200 --> 20:48.640
Yes.

20:49.030 --> 20:49.830
It'll only take a quarter.

20:52.880 --> 20:53.920
Send someone to check

20:54.030 --> 20:55.350
if Lan has finished picking.

20:55.680 --> 20:56.680
If so,

20:56.680 --> 20:58.110
tell her we should go back.

20:59.550 --> 21:00.550
Besides the crate of Wu silk

21:00.750 --> 21:02.310
and the crate of plain gauze

21:02.440 --> 21:03.480
I just picked,

21:03.880 --> 21:05.000
go to Simingzhai

21:05.160 --> 21:06.350
and choose two Song carvings.

21:06.480 --> 21:07.680
And our Linxia House's

21:07.680 --> 21:08.590
new pastries.

21:08.880 --> 21:10.640
Pack them in an eight-treasure box,

21:10.830 --> 21:12.070
and send it to the Chen residence.

21:12.200 --> 21:12.830
Understood?

21:16.400 --> 21:17.240
When giving gifts,

21:17.400 --> 21:18.510
we must send the very best.

21:18.510 --> 21:19.000
Yes, Miss.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.200
[It's Chen Yanyun.]

21:27.480 --> 21:28.350
Can you handle it?

21:29.480 --> 21:30.350
Don't worry, sir.

21:48.400 --> 21:49.550
Congratulations, sir.

21:49.680 --> 21:51.200
I heard Chen Xuanqing

21:51.270 --> 21:52.110
and Chen Yanwen

21:52.350 --> 21:53.550
both passed the imperial exams.

21:54.270 --> 21:55.160
Congratulations.

21:55.640 --> 21:56.880
I've prepared gifts

21:57.350 --> 21:58.070
and had someone

21:58.270 --> 21:59.640
all sent to the Chen residence.

22:01.070 --> 22:02.440
Thank you for your trouble.

22:23.680 --> 22:24.680
Would you like a piece?

22:24.960 --> 22:25.880
This jujube pastry

22:26.000 --> 22:26.480
is made by

22:26.480 --> 22:27.750
our shop's chef.

22:28.440 --> 22:29.480
You can't buy it elsewhere.

22:35.000 --> 22:35.480
Sir,

22:35.960 --> 22:36.920
it's done.

22:38.790 --> 22:40.200
[It's because of his broken carriage.]

22:53.000 --> 22:53.720
That's enough.

22:54.680 --> 22:55.270
Thank you.

23:02.400 --> 23:03.920
[He is so strange]

23:04.240 --> 23:05.680
[and hard to read.]

23:08.960 --> 23:09.510
Miss,

23:10.160 --> 23:11.110
Mr. Chen

23:11.750 --> 23:12.920
seems a bit

23:13.070 --> 23:14.270
unhappy.

23:14.310 --> 23:15.270
You also think so?

23:17.440 --> 23:18.510
Looks like the Chen family

23:18.640 --> 23:19.750
has plenty of secrets.

23:21.310 --> 23:21.790
Look,

23:22.070 --> 23:23.160
don't send those four

23:23.270 --> 23:23.960
I picked.

23:24.640 --> 23:26.590
Just pick four

23:26.720 --> 23:27.640
ordinary ones.

23:28.030 --> 23:28.790
No rush.

23:29.000 --> 23:30.550
Send them quietly

23:30.720 --> 23:32.510
with the rest of their guests.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.240
Yes, Miss.

23:38.070 --> 23:38.960
Why are you

23:38.960 --> 23:40.350
so happy today?

23:41.200 --> 23:41.680
The autumn

23:42.070 --> 23:43.030
exam results came out.

23:44.070 --> 23:45.680
Liu Xiancheng didn't pass.

23:46.030 --> 23:46.750
That makes

23:47.790 --> 23:49.070
this marriage

23:49.400 --> 23:49.920
secure.

23:50.680 --> 23:51.790
No wonder they sent his birth-date

23:51.960 --> 23:53.000
betrothal slip

23:53.000 --> 23:53.720
right over

23:53.720 --> 23:54.640
in the afternoon.

23:54.830 --> 23:56.030
It's because he failed the exam.

23:58.350 --> 24:00.240
People are always like that.

24:00.510 --> 24:01.790
Nothing surprising.

24:02.110 --> 24:02.750
It won't be too late

24:03.160 --> 24:04.110
to marry Jinzhao to him

24:04.110 --> 24:05.270
after he passes the exams later.

24:05.640 --> 24:06.480
He won't pass.

24:06.680 --> 24:07.880
I had people inquire.

24:08.550 --> 24:09.830
This boy

24:10.400 --> 24:11.720
is lecherous.

24:12.680 --> 24:13.880
Young as he is,

24:14.110 --> 24:15.830
he already keeps several chamber maids

24:16.440 --> 24:17.510
and even a mistress outside

24:17.510 --> 24:18.480
for nearly a year.

24:19.480 --> 24:20.550
How can such a person

24:20.790 --> 24:22.030
pass the exams?

24:23.790 --> 24:24.640
Is this match

24:25.160 --> 24:26.070
still worth pursuing?

24:26.270 --> 24:27.510
A man being lustful

24:28.160 --> 24:28.880
is nothing

24:29.480 --> 24:30.960
but a minor flaw.

24:31.590 --> 24:33.590
This boy may be disappointing,

24:34.240 --> 24:35.750
but his father is not.

24:36.880 --> 24:38.200
Word's already out.

24:38.510 --> 24:40.030
The Junior Vice Minister of Revenue

24:40.750 --> 24:41.790
is bound to be his father,

24:42.400 --> 24:43.790
Liu Siyu.

24:44.160 --> 24:45.070
Really?

24:45.510 --> 24:47.440
With this marriage connection,

24:47.960 --> 24:49.550
even if I don't get praised

24:50.590 --> 24:52.680
in this performance review,

24:53.110 --> 24:53.550
at least

24:54.720 --> 24:57.440
a passable rating is safe.

25:00.550 --> 25:01.030
Come on.

25:07.070 --> 25:08.550
Why are you sighing?

25:08.830 --> 25:10.400
What does Mrs. Ji's reply say?

25:12.030 --> 25:13.920
She didn't say it outright.

25:14.960 --> 25:16.480
It's an unsaid understanding.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.400
For now, we should focus on

25:20.590 --> 25:21.830
this marriage arrangement.

25:23.790 --> 25:24.480
The Liu sent over

25:24.480 --> 25:25.750
the birth-date betrothal

25:25.750 --> 25:26.750
slip today.

25:27.350 --> 25:28.920
Mistress Song even asked Madame

25:28.920 --> 25:30.720
for your birth details.

25:31.270 --> 25:32.510
But Madame hasn't given her yet,

25:32.920 --> 25:34.830
saying she needed to think it over.

25:35.480 --> 25:36.720
Once the slips are exchanged,

25:36.880 --> 25:37.790
backing out

25:38.070 --> 25:39.160
would cause

25:39.270 --> 25:40.310
bad rumors.

25:41.030 --> 25:42.590
Anyway, no matter what they do,

25:43.030 --> 25:43.880
I won't ever marry

25:43.880 --> 25:44.830
into the Liu family.

25:45.350 --> 25:46.200
Madame is too soft

25:46.400 --> 25:47.350
and has no real power.

25:47.830 --> 25:48.960
Speaking to her is useless.

25:51.510 --> 25:52.880
Grandmother is ill,

25:53.160 --> 25:54.070
yet she didn't mention it

25:54.270 --> 25:55.240
at all in her letter.

25:56.790 --> 25:58.000
The more she's like this,

25:59.160 --> 26:00.830
the less I should trouble her.

26:02.640 --> 26:04.030
If it really comes down to it,

26:05.000 --> 26:06.310
I'll fight our way out

26:06.720 --> 26:07.720
and back to Tongzhou.

26:07.960 --> 26:08.880
Who cares about the Liu!

26:11.110 --> 26:12.070
Keep that move

26:12.070 --> 26:13.400
for the very end of our rope.

26:17.110 --> 26:18.110
For now,

26:19.160 --> 26:20.750
there are two men who can help.

26:21.920 --> 26:22.720
Who are they?

26:40.270 --> 26:41.440
This Rain of Pear Blossom

26:41.510 --> 26:42.310
Needles devised by

26:42.310 --> 26:43.480
Mr. Xiao is deadly.

26:43.680 --> 26:45.350
If I hadn't been wearing chest armor,

26:45.350 --> 26:46.440
I would be dead for sure.

26:47.510 --> 26:48.750
So I should coat these needles

26:48.750 --> 26:49.790
with a potent poison.

26:50.510 --> 26:52.310
Then I wouldn't need to aim for the chest,

26:53.830 --> 26:55.680
but a scratch

26:55.880 --> 26:57.160
would be fatal.

26:58.240 --> 26:59.310
We'll test it later.

26:59.920 --> 27:01.550
Who to test it on?

27:03.310 --> 27:03.720
Hey!

27:04.030 --> 27:05.480
Sir, don't look at me!

27:05.550 --> 27:06.200
I...

27:09.640 --> 27:11.160
There is actually someone.

27:11.720 --> 27:12.480
Shut up!

27:13.000 --> 27:13.750
Say that again,

27:14.110 --> 27:15.200
and I might not be able to stop myself

27:15.400 --> 27:16.030
from seeking justice

27:16.200 --> 27:17.030
for this horse.

27:20.720 --> 27:22.310
Sir. Master has returned.

27:22.310 --> 27:23.000
He's waiting for you.

27:30.110 --> 27:31.400
Why did you give away

27:31.400 --> 27:32.310
your personal sword?

27:32.550 --> 27:33.110
That

27:33.110 --> 27:34.440
should have been kept for Xian.

27:35.680 --> 27:36.680
Kept for him?

27:37.720 --> 27:39.110
Could he even lift it?

27:39.750 --> 27:41.070
Look at that scrawny frame.

27:41.510 --> 27:42.920
He'll never wield a sword in this lifetime.

27:43.070 --> 27:43.960
I know.

27:44.270 --> 27:45.350
You blame me for not

27:45.960 --> 27:47.750
giving you a son to be a general on horseback.

27:51.830 --> 27:52.510
Dear,

27:53.640 --> 27:54.510
don't be angry.

27:55.070 --> 27:55.510
Come on.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.000
Sir.

28:02.070 --> 28:02.880
Let him know I'm here.

28:03.110 --> 28:03.590
Yes, sir.

28:06.240 --> 28:07.270
Master. Ma'am.

28:07.480 --> 28:08.310
Here comes the young master.

28:15.350 --> 28:16.510
Master. Ma'am.

28:16.720 --> 28:18.590
Father. Mother.

28:21.790 --> 28:23.480
I heard you're tinkering with hidden weapons again.

28:24.110 --> 28:25.590
Tricks and gadgets.

28:26.070 --> 28:27.160
Even if you can't ride a horse,

28:27.160 --> 28:27.920
or wield a sword,

28:27.960 --> 28:29.270
you should still learn military texts.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.480
What do we

28:30.480 --> 28:31.720
martial nobles rely on?

28:31.960 --> 28:33.720
Real military merit!

28:34.790 --> 28:35.510
Enough.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.790
First thing first.

28:38.480 --> 28:39.590
His Majesty has appointed you

28:40.590 --> 28:41.720
as the Crown Prince's companion.

28:42.720 --> 28:44.030
Go pack. Tomorrow, you

28:44.030 --> 28:45.030
come with me to the palace.

28:45.590 --> 28:46.720
The Crown Prince's companion?

28:47.480 --> 28:48.160
Why would His Majesty

28:48.160 --> 28:49.270
think of me out of the blue?

28:50.480 --> 28:51.880
Why you?

28:52.550 --> 28:54.480
Because the Office thought you're

28:54.550 --> 28:55.440
at the perfect age.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.310
So you're going.

28:58.750 --> 28:59.830
It's Chen Yanyun.

29:00.920 --> 29:01.880
Listen well.

29:02.310 --> 29:03.400
To accompany the Crown Prince,

29:03.960 --> 29:05.000
you must be careful with

29:05.110 --> 29:06.000
your behavior and learn hard.

29:07.790 --> 29:09.070
Learn what?

29:09.200 --> 29:10.790
Learn whatever you're told to learn!

29:11.590 --> 29:12.510
What about military texts?

29:12.680 --> 29:13.110
You!

29:14.510 --> 29:15.880
- Sir!
- You're asking for trouble!

29:20.830 --> 29:22.270
What are you doing?

29:30.240 --> 29:31.000
Tomorrow morning,

29:31.750 --> 29:33.350
send someone to deliver this letter

29:33.350 --> 29:34.310
to the Changxing.

29:34.550 --> 29:35.510
How can that be?

29:35.680 --> 29:36.550
It's so important.

29:36.640 --> 29:37.920
I'd better deliver it myself.

29:38.160 --> 29:38.680
No need.

29:38.790 --> 29:40.000
Just send anyone.

29:40.680 --> 29:42.110
If the letter doesn't arrive,

29:42.640 --> 29:43.880
send this one

29:44.270 --> 29:45.310
to Ye Xian.

29:47.960 --> 29:49.590
Are you trying to...

29:50.070 --> 29:51.750
Haven't we always wanted to find out

29:52.000 --> 29:53.070
who the lurker is?

29:54.400 --> 29:55.440
Then,

29:55.640 --> 29:58.110
let's lure the snake out of its hole.

30:14.510 --> 30:15.400
Huang?

30:18.270 --> 30:19.640
You have great taste, young lady.

30:26.000 --> 30:27.160
Miss Gu

30:27.720 --> 30:29.440
is grasping at straws.

30:30.160 --> 30:32.030
How could the Changxing heir

30:32.550 --> 30:34.160
ever help with that?

30:37.030 --> 30:38.310
Who knows.

30:42.480 --> 30:44.110
Dispose of this letter, Chen Yi.

30:45.830 --> 30:46.880
Not to send it to

30:46.880 --> 30:48.030
the Changxing as is?

30:48.240 --> 30:48.920
No.

30:50.000 --> 30:51.550
The one she really meant to send

30:52.110 --> 30:53.480
has probably already arrived.

30:53.720 --> 30:54.680
Sorry,

30:55.200 --> 30:55.750
but I don't get it.

30:56.510 --> 30:57.920
Your mole is probably

30:58.400 --> 30:59.960
already blown.

31:01.000 --> 31:01.640
No way!

31:02.480 --> 31:04.110
She's at most gotten

31:04.110 --> 31:05.000
suspicious.

31:05.400 --> 31:07.400
No way she knows who it is!

31:07.790 --> 31:08.440
Then let me ask.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.270
Last time, Miss Gu's letter

31:10.270 --> 31:11.750
to Mrs. Ji

31:11.880 --> 31:13.160
was sealed with wax.

31:13.830 --> 31:15.160
This time, none.

31:15.750 --> 31:16.550
What do you think?

31:19.160 --> 31:20.270
That maid beside Miss Gu

31:20.310 --> 31:21.070
knows martial arts, right?

31:21.200 --> 31:21.960
Maybe she's

31:22.160 --> 31:22.880
already

31:22.880 --> 31:24.350
tailed your men.

31:25.400 --> 31:25.880
Sir, forgive me.

31:26.400 --> 31:28.030
I deserve death for my mistake.

31:28.200 --> 31:29.270
Not quite,

31:29.270 --> 31:30.440
but there are indeed lapses.

31:30.750 --> 31:32.000
Go receive your punishment.

31:32.510 --> 31:34.510
As for those watching Gu Jinzhao.

31:34.720 --> 31:35.510
Pull them back.

31:35.750 --> 31:36.200
Yes, sir.

31:44.790 --> 31:46.070
This Gu Jinzhao

31:47.480 --> 31:48.480
is truly clever.

31:48.790 --> 31:49.480
Clever,

31:50.070 --> 31:51.000
and bold too.

31:51.440 --> 31:52.750
She's scheming against me as well.

31:54.750 --> 31:56.400
You think this letter

31:56.400 --> 31:57.880
was just for Ye Xian?

31:59.070 --> 31:59.720
No way!

32:01.070 --> 32:02.270
She thought you'd

32:02.720 --> 32:03.830
help her too

32:03.830 --> 32:04.830
after reading it?

32:07.790 --> 32:08.790
Would you?

32:09.000 --> 32:09.880
No.

32:10.240 --> 32:10.960
Of course not!

32:11.590 --> 32:13.000
That thought of hers

32:13.000 --> 32:14.400
is just too arrogant.

32:14.830 --> 32:16.400
To you, it's arrogance.

32:16.750 --> 32:18.310
To her, it's an opportunity.

32:18.720 --> 32:20.440
One letter, but shown to two people.

32:20.830 --> 32:22.550
If even one of them agrees to help,

32:22.830 --> 32:23.680
she wins.

32:24.640 --> 32:25.720
Why not do it?

32:26.830 --> 32:28.030
Indeed.

32:29.880 --> 32:31.110
A trades-person's way of thinking

32:31.110 --> 32:32.030
is completely different

32:32.030 --> 32:32.790
from a scholar's.

32:33.310 --> 32:35.110
There are plenty of scholars at court.

32:35.480 --> 32:37.160
If half knew how to do trade,

32:38.030 --> 32:39.790
the treasury wouldn't be so empty.

32:43.310 --> 32:44.750
This Gu Jinzhao

32:45.240 --> 32:46.720
has something of

32:46.720 --> 32:48.160
Mrs. Ji's style about her.

32:49.030 --> 32:50.440
No wonder you wanted

32:51.160 --> 32:52.750
to test her.

32:54.350 --> 32:55.750
Suddenly I feel

32:56.000 --> 32:57.400
it'd be a pity

32:57.400 --> 32:58.680
to withdraw the mole.

32:58.790 --> 32:59.720
What do you mean?

33:01.880 --> 33:03.350
It's been a while

33:03.680 --> 33:05.350
since I've seen you this happy.

33:12.550 --> 33:14.240
It's the driver, Huang.

33:15.240 --> 33:16.270
Huang?

33:17.480 --> 33:18.510
It's actually him?

33:19.400 --> 33:20.720
When we were in danger in the capital,

33:21.270 --> 33:22.550
I saw how quickly he reacted.

33:22.880 --> 33:24.350
I thought it's just because he's skilled.

33:25.070 --> 33:26.070
But thinking back,

33:26.310 --> 33:27.640
he probably knows martial arts.

33:28.160 --> 33:29.790
I gave the letter to the Changxing.

33:30.310 --> 33:31.400
Bodyguard Li,

33:31.400 --> 33:32.590
who serves Ye Xian, told me

33:32.720 --> 33:33.880
Ye Xian has entered the palace

33:34.030 --> 33:35.440
as the Crown Prince's companion

33:35.790 --> 33:36.960
and can't come out

33:36.960 --> 33:37.790
until his rest day,

33:38.200 --> 33:39.030
which means we should wait

33:40.440 --> 33:41.240
at least a month.

33:41.510 --> 33:42.440
A month?

33:44.160 --> 33:45.270
That's too long.

33:51.480 --> 33:52.550
I need another idea.

33:53.000 --> 33:53.510
Qingpu,

33:53.680 --> 33:54.590
go keep an eye on the Liu.

34:01.720 --> 34:03.160
Rest for a quarter.

34:09.070 --> 34:10.230
Bring Frost over.

34:11.030 --> 34:12.510
Here comes Frost!

34:14.400 --> 34:14.920
Frost!

34:14.920 --> 34:15.630
Go catch it!

34:15.760 --> 34:16.510
Stop!

34:16.760 --> 34:17.760
Go catch it!

34:18.070 --> 34:19.030
Frost is there!

34:19.230 --> 34:20.190
It's over there!

34:21.400 --> 34:22.360
Go catch it!

34:23.000 --> 34:23.880
It's over there!

34:28.880 --> 34:29.550
Come on!

34:30.590 --> 34:31.280
There!

34:31.280 --> 34:31.670
There!

34:32.400 --> 34:33.280
Over there!

34:41.190 --> 34:41.800
Quick!

34:41.800 --> 34:42.440
Surround it!

34:46.070 --> 34:46.710
Frost!

34:46.880 --> 34:47.360
Come here!

35:00.840 --> 35:02.030
Mr. Ye is so capable.

35:02.480 --> 35:03.320
In just a few days,

35:03.880 --> 35:04.590
you have Frost

35:04.760 --> 35:06.030
completely tamed.

35:06.900 --> 35:08.960
I merely used a trivial trick.

35:11.670 --> 35:13.440
It's honey!

35:14.150 --> 35:16.000
Thank you for the lesson, Mr. Ye.

35:18.070 --> 35:18.670
Your Highness.

35:19.000 --> 35:19.710
Mr. Ye.

35:20.070 --> 35:21.190
You have a letter.

35:25.920 --> 35:27.440
[I wanted to refuse outright,]

35:28.110 --> 35:30.150
[but I hear the Liu family is related to the marquisate.]

35:30.710 --> 35:31.880
[Making a scene would be a small matter,]

35:32.510 --> 35:34.000
[while hurting the marquisate's face is not.]

35:38.000 --> 35:39.070
Threatening me?

35:40.590 --> 35:41.960
What nerve!

35:42.480 --> 35:43.230
Sir, I'll take my leave

35:43.440 --> 35:44.510
if there's nothing else.

36:10.960 --> 36:12.400
Amazing!

36:13.030 --> 36:15.280
That's just so amazing!

36:15.920 --> 36:17.480
His Highness bestows a reward!

36:18.480 --> 36:19.710
It's mine! It's mine!

36:19.960 --> 36:21.070
Quick!

36:22.440 --> 36:23.360
Ye Xian,

36:23.360 --> 36:24.320
look at these scoundrels.

36:24.760 --> 36:26.800
Quick! Whoever grabs it keeps it.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.710
Mine, mine!

36:29.320 --> 36:29.920
What?

36:30.190 --> 36:31.480
Mr. Chen is here?

36:31.480 --> 36:32.030
Mine!

36:32.320 --> 36:32.920
Quick!

36:32.920 --> 36:33.550
Put these away!

36:33.880 --> 36:34.480
Move!

36:34.960 --> 36:35.840
Come here, this way!

36:35.840 --> 36:36.670
Quick, quick!

36:36.670 --> 36:37.590
Quick, quick!

36:37.920 --> 36:38.840
Put these away!

36:39.510 --> 36:40.880
Over there!

36:57.150 --> 36:58.670
Chen Yanyun, Chief of the Crown Prince's Office

36:58.670 --> 37:00.670
and Lecturer to the Eastern Palace,

37:00.670 --> 37:03.000
requests an audience with His Highness.

37:21.480 --> 37:22.070
Your servant

37:22.960 --> 37:24.590
kowtows to Your Highness.

37:25.550 --> 37:26.550
Rise, Mr. Chen.

37:28.320 --> 37:29.190
I was just reading

37:29.440 --> 37:31.480
Direct Explanations of the Four Books

37:32.230 --> 37:33.550
and recalled that you once said: extending

37:34.030 --> 37:35.190
knowledge comes from the Great Learning,

37:35.840 --> 37:37.710
and innate knowledge comes from Mencius.

37:38.230 --> 37:39.030
I've gained some insight.

38:02.630 --> 38:03.880
Your Highness.

38:04.590 --> 38:05.880
You neglected your studies

38:06.150 --> 38:07.400
and falsified things.

38:07.920 --> 38:08.710
According to the rules,

38:09.280 --> 38:09.880
you should be

38:10.360 --> 38:11.630
punished with three strikes on the palm.

38:12.440 --> 38:13.070
Does Your Highness

38:13.760 --> 38:14.550
have any objection?

38:15.880 --> 38:17.670
N-no.

38:18.510 --> 38:19.030
Good.

38:19.840 --> 38:20.360
Take the tool.

38:20.400 --> 38:20.960
Wait.

38:21.960 --> 38:22.550
What?

38:23.070 --> 38:24.230
What do you want to say?

38:25.400 --> 38:26.920
You saw His Highness playing

38:27.150 --> 38:28.800
and assumed he has neglected his studies.

38:29.400 --> 38:30.320
What you don't know is that

38:30.320 --> 38:31.280
His Highness rose at three,

38:31.710 --> 38:32.480
first studied two hours

38:32.480 --> 38:33.440
with Lecturer Wang,

38:33.800 --> 38:34.760
then continued reading

38:34.760 --> 38:35.880
until afternoon.

38:36.710 --> 38:37.880
Still underage, His Highness

38:38.110 --> 38:39.760
sleeps barely three hours a night.

38:40.230 --> 38:41.230
His workload is far heavier

38:41.590 --> 38:42.880
than that of ordinary scholars.

38:43.590 --> 38:45.280
He just relaxes briefly.

38:45.760 --> 38:46.510
Mr. Chen,

38:47.360 --> 38:48.800
why be so harsh?

38:49.280 --> 38:49.920
His Highness

38:50.400 --> 38:51.230
is the Crown Prince,

38:51.760 --> 38:53.110
not ordinary scholar.

38:53.440 --> 38:54.360
That's the first point.

38:56.360 --> 38:57.840
If His Highness finds

38:58.190 --> 38:59.880
the workload too heavy,

39:00.190 --> 39:02.000
he could simply order me to revise the schedule.

39:03.320 --> 39:04.400
Instead, he hid the truth

39:04.630 --> 39:06.000
from me with his servants' help.

39:07.280 --> 39:08.280
My punishment

39:08.800 --> 39:10.400
is not for playing.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.960
It's for deceiving himself and others.

39:13.320 --> 39:14.230
That's the second point.

39:14.920 --> 39:15.590
Does Your Highness

39:16.320 --> 39:17.480
accept the punishment?

39:18.590 --> 39:19.800
You're right, sir.

39:20.710 --> 39:21.710
I accept the punishment.

39:22.030 --> 39:23.070
Alright. Take the tool.

39:23.400 --> 39:23.960
Wait.

39:25.230 --> 39:26.590
As His Highness's companion,

39:26.920 --> 39:28.000
I can't bear to see him punished.

39:28.590 --> 39:29.670
I'll take the punishment in his place.

39:30.280 --> 39:30.920
Ye Xian.

39:34.800 --> 39:35.670
Mr. Ye

39:36.760 --> 39:37.800
is truly loyal.

39:41.800 --> 39:42.550
But unfortunately,

39:43.070 --> 39:44.360
you're not qualified to take

39:45.000 --> 39:46.190
His Highness's punishment.

39:47.550 --> 39:48.630
As his companion,

39:48.630 --> 39:49.880
your failure to counsel him

39:51.190 --> 39:52.360
already warrants punishment.

39:56.920 --> 39:57.630
The tool!

39:58.000 --> 39:59.190
Crown Prince,

39:59.590 --> 40:00.510
three strikes on the hand.

40:01.840 --> 40:02.590
Mr. Ye,

40:03.230 --> 40:04.280
thirty.

40:07.510 --> 40:08.920
Mr. Ye, forgive me.

40:14.670 --> 40:15.630
Twelve.

40:28.360 --> 40:31.230
Twenty-seven, twenty-eight, twenty-nine.

40:31.480 --> 40:32.550
Thirty.

40:48.840 --> 40:49.710
Mr. ye,

40:50.110 --> 40:51.070
do you admit your fault?

40:58.110 --> 40:59.400
You did this to get back at me

40:59.630 --> 41:00.320
for what I said

41:00.320 --> 41:01.440
at Lin Xianzhong's house, didn't you?

41:02.360 --> 41:03.880
That's why you made me a companion

41:04.070 --> 41:04.880
in the East Palace.

41:11.070 --> 41:13.070
You're really petty.

41:14.760 --> 41:16.190
How about another thirty strikes?

41:18.070 --> 41:18.880
I admit my fault.

41:23.110 --> 41:24.550
What you have taught me today,

41:26.030 --> 41:27.150
I dare not forget.

41:30.960 --> 41:31.670
Your Highness,

41:32.000 --> 41:33.320
it's getting late.

41:33.550 --> 41:34.550
Please go rest

41:35.230 --> 41:37.110
after you catch up on your studies.

41:38.880 --> 41:39.510
Your servant

41:40.070 --> 41:40.840
takes leave.

41:50.480 --> 41:52.190
You're strict with the Crown Prince,

41:52.550 --> 41:53.840
but rarely resorts to physical punishment.

41:54.630 --> 41:56.230
Why the strikes today?

41:56.710 --> 41:58.400
Ye Xian has been in the palace less than three days,

41:58.590 --> 41:59.760
yet the Crown Prince's tricks

41:59.760 --> 42:00.920
are already evolving.

42:01.400 --> 42:02.550
Without a few strikes,

42:02.630 --> 42:03.710
he wouldn't learn the seriousness

42:04.440 --> 42:06.070
and he'd get more and more out of hand.

42:06.920 --> 42:07.630
Actually,

42:08.710 --> 42:10.230
this is also doing Ye Xian a favor.

42:12.670 --> 42:13.760
Unless I'm mistaken,

42:13.760 --> 42:15.280
after those thirty strikes,

42:16.070 --> 42:17.550
Ye Xian will be able to leave tomorrow.

42:19.360 --> 42:20.030
You're not

42:20.030 --> 42:21.670
helping Mr. Ye.

42:21.840 --> 42:23.440
You're helping Miss Gu!

42:29.920 --> 42:31.440
That Madame Liu is so unbearable.

42:31.960 --> 42:33.030
The first time you meet,

42:33.030 --> 42:34.550
she grabbed your hand and wouldn't let go,

42:35.000 --> 42:37.760
keeping going on about figure, eyes, brows, something like that.

42:38.510 --> 42:40.280
Looked like she wanted to touch you already!

42:41.110 --> 42:41.960
She's nothing like

42:42.230 --> 42:43.920
the sister of the Marchioness.

42:44.630 --> 42:45.960
She's just like a slave trader!

42:47.320 --> 42:48.800
Who's tired of living,

42:49.030 --> 42:50.360
daring to badmouth the marquisate?

42:53.360 --> 42:54.510
Sir.

42:59.960 --> 43:01.150
It's just my foolish rambling.

43:01.440 --> 43:02.630
Please forgive me, sir.

43:03.710 --> 43:04.440
Get up.

43:05.230 --> 43:06.280
How did you get in?

43:06.710 --> 43:07.840
Why was there no announcement?

43:09.480 --> 43:10.670
I haven't seen you in days,

43:10.880 --> 43:12.030
yet you've grown bold,

43:12.320 --> 43:13.440
talking to me like this.

43:14.590 --> 43:15.920
I heard you're grounded.

43:16.590 --> 43:17.760
No bother announcing.

43:18.070 --> 43:19.110
I just climbed the wall.

43:21.110 --> 43:23.030
Qingpu, go outside and keep watch.

43:23.710 --> 43:24.840
Yes, Miss.

43:31.840 --> 43:32.880
What are you waiting for?

43:33.360 --> 43:34.440
Serve me some tea.

44:02.400 --> 44:03.360
What tea is this?

44:03.800 --> 44:05.000
Smells bad already.

44:06.480 --> 44:07.110
Never mind.

44:08.030 --> 44:09.000
Back to business.

44:10.190 --> 44:11.510
You don't want to marry into the Liu family?

44:12.070 --> 44:12.590
No.

44:13.480 --> 44:15.110
If my father insists,

44:15.630 --> 44:17.230
even if I have to make a scene,

44:17.630 --> 44:18.760
I'll do it to refuse.

44:20.110 --> 44:21.480
Always making a scene.

44:22.230 --> 44:22.760
You really

44:22.760 --> 44:24.190
don't care about your own face.

44:24.800 --> 44:26.190
For a woman,

44:26.440 --> 44:27.590
marriage is a lifetime matter.

44:27.710 --> 44:28.590
What is face

44:29.030 --> 44:30.000
compared to that?

44:31.110 --> 44:32.110
Look at you.

44:32.590 --> 44:33.630
All you've got left

44:34.590 --> 44:35.920
is this pretty face.

44:36.510 --> 44:37.800
Otherwise, with your terrible attitude,

44:38.030 --> 44:39.280
who would dare to marry you?
